{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23128","headline":"西省对花忆忠州东坡新花树因寄题东楼 · 白居易","name":"西省对花忆忠州东坡新花树因寄题东楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每看阙下丹青树，不忘天边锦绣林。\n西掖垣中今日眼，南宾楼上去年心。\n花含春意无分别，物感人情有浅深。\n最忆东坡红烂熳，野桃山杏水林檎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}